{"server":"tw","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_07_beg","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_07","title":"我的羅盤","storyCode":"EP-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"908bb1f8280f4ef8944efabdb33561745557f3a50706c2a7d80176237a9359e4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"安納斯塔西奧召集人手，駕船追殺逃走的棘刺一行人。征服宣告號被擊中，棘刺為了搶救即將崩潰的心相原質，不惜將手伸入法術能量場中。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g14_ibtown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時間點，不睡覺在外面幹嘛？你的火把也太刺眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傻孩子，這是在城鎮，不用擔心半夜有鹽鱗衝進營地，也不會突然刮鹽暴把帳篷吹走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我只是不習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屋子裡太熱，床也太堅固，甚至都不會晃……我睡不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我總覺得不對勁。是那個叫西爾弗的證裁官把我們安排在這裡嗎？他人呢？怎麼不見了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礙於身分，不方便與我們直接接觸吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮民們還是對我們抱有戒備，不然也不會特地讓我們半夜進小鎮，住在小鎮內這些空了很久的老房子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們和他們一樣都是人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火把給我吧。不放心的話，我在這裡再觀察一陣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你快點回去睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮裡的生活，你總要習慣的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來，你們今天吃的還是從船上帶來的肉乾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是，肉乾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這間廚房雖然已經棄置很久了，但西爾弗特地找人修繕過，裡面的廚具應該都能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽聞你一直想當個真正的廚師。為什麼有了廚房，反而不煮飯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天做不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼意思？你是覺得這些還不夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，夠了。我一輩子也沒見過這麼多廚具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那究竟是為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道為什麼，哈維爾先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煮飯的人在煮飯的時候，腦子裡想的大多不是手裡的廚具，而是等等要吃飯的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煮飯的時候總在想的人不在了，飯也就做不出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的同夥都在這裡了，如果你說的是先前那場圍剿中執意抵抗的人，那我想我們都不必感到惋惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明得到了許多珍貴之物，這些廚具，這些食材……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是西爾弗準備的，不是你。為什麼是你在這裡說這些鬼話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你殺了他……是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我殺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們呢？你也打算殺了我們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我要你們與我走上相同的道路——贖罪的道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡得好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不太好。房裡太熱、床不會晃我努力一下都能忍耐，但這裡的牆壁不透風！吹不到風我覺得我的臉都要僵掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知足吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看船隊裡的老傢伙，一個兩個臉都被風吹歪了。那副長相走在街上，恐怕都會把人嚇跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還年輕，還有機會長成一個慈眉善目的漂亮姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廚房沒煙。哈維爾還是不打算做飯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去找他談。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教士們搜遍了你們窩點的每一個角落，並沒有發現失竊的羅盤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那種小東西，可能已經被燒成灰了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與此事有關的幾個重要人物，那個竊取羅盤的女孩、那個盜食鎮民遺體的青年，和你們先前的首領……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們帶著贓物，藏進了鹽漠深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還要我們去追？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們比我更瞭解如何在鹽漠中穿行，也更熟悉在逃的幾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報酬呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們做事，你們給錢，這裡的規矩不就是這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鹽漠裡面十分危險，幾十公尺長的大鹽鱗，動動腦袋就能把人撞個四分五裂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有最深處的骸礁峽谷，裡面的蒸汽柱隨便就能在人身上噴出一個洞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不多給一點不像話吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，都閉嘴！我們沒必要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要什麼？我們只是在鎮上住了一個晚上，還沒有穩定的生計呢！有工作來了，難道沒必要接嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你們別太著急了，哈維爾不是那個意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執裁官閣下，你看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近來受審查的那幾支商隊，前些天剛剛運來一批錢財與貨物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些身外之物，於我無用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的海盜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，之前跟他們做生意的時候，我就覺得他們藏著不少好東西沒拿出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，沒有你們想的那麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夥計們，都聽到了，這次能成功就有錢拿。都別湊熱鬧了，快去船上做準備！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"安納斯塔西奧告訴自己，眼前這些人已然淪為慾望的傀儡，不論心底是否願意作惡，他們都會在慾望的驅使下踏上惡途。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你傻了嗎？你以為西爾弗去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論這背後有什麼陰謀，都不是我們有資格插手的。我只能裝傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼陰謀，魯斯，西爾弗死了，安納斯塔西奧殺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不是什麼陰謀家，他是個純粹的瘋子，而現在已經沒有人能控制他了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有別的辦法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家現在對你是什麼態度，你都看到了。你這個首領的威望，還不如一頓飽飯來得實在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況你現在連飯都不做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾，我能袒護你的時間不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……走吧，我們開船。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……好亮……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……好痛……全身都好痛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒了？你昨天發了點燒，現在已經退了，喝點水吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"帕斯卡拉撐起身子，接過蒂奇遞來的水袋。另一邊，仿生海龍吊著一塊木板，正奮力搧動薄翼。\n胡安娜站在船頭眺望遠方，在她身後，極境全身都跟著沉重的舵輪扭動了起來，就像是在做體操。\n頭頂的太陽曬得人皮膚刺痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是最後一點水了，每人一小袋，省著點喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……有什麼我能做的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，小丫頭，我很高興又看到你活蹦亂跳的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修補船體、加固桅杆，還有處理食物……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，我們需要做的事情還有很多呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修船的事情有小葉幫忙，不然還是讓她再躺一下吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天那樣我都沒事，晚上沒有撞上骸骨，也沒有被鹽鱗頂飛，現在還有水喝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要做點什麼……做點什麼讓我自己活著回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，把手給我，我拉你起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g8_oldcabin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你，你的水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這些是你的肉乾。我們討論好了，你就在船艙裡專心修復羅盤，我們來負責外面的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了羅盤，我們就不會迷失方向，後面的事情到時候再做打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還有多少時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士說，我們走得還不夠遠，最遲明天早上，我們就會被追上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天早上……？對修復羅盤來說時間太短……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你盡力就好。如果實在來不及，胡安娜女士說了，就算沒有羅盤，她也要試試拚死在骸礁峽谷闖出一條路來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，這個給你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我改造過的通訊器，在極端環境裡也能傳訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"見鱗屎了，有帆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有帆！西南方向——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡待著，我先去幫忙了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到他們的帆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加速，追上它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不建議現在就加速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照他們現在的航向來看，如果我們加速追趕，只會把他們逼進骸礁峽谷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡不是人能去的地方！他們可能會死在裡面，而且我們也進不去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執裁官閣下，請再考慮下，那樣羅盤恐怕也會毀掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅盤不是你需要考慮的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在鹽漠上航行了幾十年，我知道該如何逼停一艘鹽船。至少讓我試一試……許多人不必白白死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你沒有太多機會可以浪費，哈維爾先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾！你到底怎麼想的？我們上次用這招是多少年前了？對胡安娜怎麼可能管用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道她不會停船，但哪怕能讓他們轉頭，也比逼他們進骸礁峽谷還好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾，你現在把自己僅剩的那點威信浪費完了，等一下整個船隊都會失控！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對安納斯塔西奧唯命是從，也不會幫我維持住我那搖搖欲墜的威信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後聽我一次！我們保持慢速追擊，另一艘船往東邊繞行，把他們攔下來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的船，剛剛是不是少了一艘？……是被鹽鱗撞停了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我教出來的人，他們的駕駛技術還不至於爛到在平地上會被鹽鱗撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意觀察！那些鹽船每一艘速度都比我們腳底下的老古董還快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們想，完全可以在我們逃進骸礁峽谷之前堵死我們的去路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的被攔下來，我們怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不論人數還是裝備都處於劣勢，抵抗的話沒有勝算……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就不要被攔下來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們背後尾隨的那艘鹽船保持著極慢的航速，也沒有升起旗幟，就是為了讓我們放鬆警惕，好讓另一艘船趁機追到我們前面去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾，你難道認為事到如今，我還會猶豫要不要駛入骸礁峽谷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"升滿帆！加速！向骸礁峽谷，全速前進！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"習武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執裁官閣下，他們加速了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和你的判斷不一致，哈維爾先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打旗號，讓另一艘船升滿帆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來掌舵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人？！現在側過船身，不是等於在邀請他們開炮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們急著開炮，就會為了尋找開炮的角度而減速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，我們就有機會甩掉他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮手，準備！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"船員們使出吃奶的力氣，把混著鱗屎揉成的粗鹽球塞進炮管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開炮！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g6_olddeck_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜又一次與她的舵輪跳起舞，舵葉剜起鹽漠的血肉，巨艦俯下身來，以不可思議的角度側滑過鹽地。\n鹽製的炮彈呼嘯劃過，在離征服宣告號僅有幾公尺遠的地面上濺起鹽花。\n風帆將這艘古老的船推向那片鮮少有人踏足過的鹽漠腹地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"鹽塵中傳來了低沉的震響，帕斯卡拉還試圖從模糊的望遠鏡中分辨出什麼，然而下一個瞬間，她的視野就被一面飽滿的風帆佔滿。\n那是剛剛從追兵隊伍中消失的，另一艘鹽船。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i08"},{"type":"narration","text":"帕斯卡拉猛地放下望遠鏡，鹽船挾著滾滾鹽塵，已經直接衝到了她的眼前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命！要撞上了，要撞上了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"躲開，躲開啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不！現在減速或轉向就正中他們的下懷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鹽船的主動力風帆在船體最前方，那絕對不是什麼適合衝撞的結構！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們敢撞，他們就再也別想追上我們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要繼續前進就好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"呼啦——！\n巨大帆布被風繃緊的聲音衝進每個人的耳朵，征服宣告號越過了試圖攔截的鹽船。\n時隔幾十年，它又一次驕傲地駛在了船隊的最前方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜，你是真的瘋了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從叛變的那一刻開始，就該清楚這一點了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追上他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算了，聽我指揮，升滿帆！追上去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈維爾不再發號施令，他知道此刻已經不會再有人聽從自己。\n他穿過人群，登上艦首，然後清晰地看到了征服宣告號前方不遠處，那些高聳的巨型骸骨。\n骸骨組成的礁群，骸骨組成的迷宮，鹽漠泵動的心臟，無人敢於踏足的死地。征服宣告號義無反顧地朝著骸礁峽谷駛去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g8_oldcabin"},{"type":"narration","text":"劇烈的顛簸一刻也沒有停止，伊西多的目光一刻也沒有離開過塑金台中央漂浮的心相原質。\n層層疊疊的法術能量場將心相原質分解開來，它的內部流溢著金屬光澤。\n最細微的動作也會透過探針的針尖反映在心相原質的表面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏽蝕的合金成分已經剝離完成，新加入的合金成分也已經順利融合了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要在心相原質內部刻印好新的源石迴路……這是最不能出差錯的一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒時間反覆檢驗源石迴路的效果，必須一次搞定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手不能抖，手不能抖……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一次劇烈的顛簸，桌上被拆解下來的羅盤零件散落一地。\n伊西多一手仍緊握著探針，另一手抽出腰後的長劍在艙壁上輕輕一點，穩住了自己的身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"制海之術……既然他們能憑這套劍術在風浪中閃轉騰挪，我就也能憑這套劍術在顛簸中紋絲不動！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"船體每傾斜一次，伊西多便出一劍，艙內早已一片狼藉，一口破鍋此刻正扣在伊西多的腳上，一塊帆布此刻正纏住他的大腿。\n但他無暇顧及，他只看得見探針針尖引導的液化源石劃出的軌跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就快成功了……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不斷有汗珠順著臉頰淌入伊西多的嘴角，他感到自己握住探針的手正在失去控制，緊繃的肌肉幾乎要開始抽搐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完成了，完成了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來只要把成型的心相原質重新灌入羅盤的外殼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——呃！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多睜開被血污與鹽粒蒙住的眼，看見法術能量場在強烈的法術干擾之下開始失控。\n他的探針落在船艙的另一側，針尖已經斷成幾截。除了外殼，羅盤的其他零件都已經不知所蹤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他看見剛剛成型的心相原質，在失控的法術能量場的重壓之下，劇烈地顫動起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺，棘刺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見鱗屎了，那個安納斯塔西奧做了什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……那是審判庭的手炮，他一炮打進船艙裡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離那個煉金裝置遠一點！它被手炮的法術能量干擾，已經失控了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士，你怎麼也來了，是誰在開船？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，有人在撐著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇，蒂奇也不見了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在這裡！她的腿被一塊斷裂的木條刺穿了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惡……可惡！我沒辦法止血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺，棘刺，你說句話，你還活著嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多張了張嘴，但舌頭怎麼也舒展不開。他強撐起身體，沒時間計算自己斷了幾根肋骨。\n塑金台中，心相原質沸騰似的冒著細密的氣泡。\n伊西多知道，再多耽擱片刻，伊比利亞僅存的心相原質，連帶著他們所有的生機與希望——\n都會化為飛灰。\n得把心相原質撈出來，得把心相原質撈出來！\n伊西多絕望地想著，但他找不到羅盤的任何零件，甚至連一件像樣的工具也找不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……不……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多踉蹌著站了起來，他的左臂失去了知覺，但他的右臂還能動彈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他大步向塑金台衝去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i07_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"法術能量場的阻力比他想像中要大得多，伊西多覺得自己好像把手伸進了滾燙的岩漿中。\n手套的防護對於失控的法術能量而言形同虛設，手臂被侵蝕的劇痛令伊西多顫抖不已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺！你做什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i07_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是我的心相原質。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i07_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我的羅盤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"心相原質在伊西多的手心雀躍，像是死物獲得了生命。\n它撫過法術能量在伊西多手臂的皮肉上蝕出的每一道溝壑、每一處空洞。\n伊西多曾無數次地凝視著這團物質，試圖尋求它與自己的關聯。\n然而此刻，他無比清晰地意識到，這一度冰冷的物質，已然成了他溫熱的血肉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i07_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……啊——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
